},"notes":{"linuxserver":"No changes","upstream":"﻿\r\n## Changes\r\n\r\n\n\n### 4.11.0.13\n\n- Fix live TV regressions\n- Improve database performance\n- Support changing post-padding while recording is ongoing\n- Rework android server UI\n- Fix android server shutdown notification occasionally getting stuck\n- Fix black theme selected item highlight\n- Support remove from playlist from Included In section\n\r\n\r\n\r\n### Cumulative Changes Since Stable Release\r\n\r\n- Fix live TV regressions\n- Improve database performance\n- Improve rotation when transcoding\n- Improve live tv guide refresh performance\n- Fix regression when setting up keyword based recording\n- Fix play all and shuffle from folder view\n- Add options to render PGS, DVDSUB and DVBSUB subtitles directly in the browser without server-side burn-in. Requires Emby Server 4.11.0.10+.\n- Fix live TV regressions\n- Improve HDR10+ detection, including frame-level metadata in local files. #2182\n- Correct HEVC high-tier bitrate limits when evaluating hardware codec capabilities. #2175\n- Preserve BT.709 color information after software tone mapping in transcoding and image extraction. #2187\n- Fix Intel Quick Sync filter-device selection. #2179\n- Fix regression causing libraries to show incorrect options\n- Fix live TV regressions\n- Improve database performance\n- Fix live TV regressions\n- Support image processing with svg files\n- Fix tv series nfo regression\n- Fix play from albums tab\n- Add Czech parental ratings\n- Trim recording file name to avoid PathTooLongException\n- Update to libvips 8.18\n- Support creating image collage with libvips\n- Fix network section coming up empty in directory picker on Windows\n- Support scheduling system wakes for recordings on macOS\n- Support scheduling system wakes for recordings on Linux\n- Support deleting to recycle bin on Linux\n- Fix recording regression\n- Fix regression with Included In display not showing collections\n- Disable scanning of combined season and episode numbers in file names (e.g. 408), and require a library option to enable it\n- Support dynamic series orders from Tvdb\n- Add automatic subtitles on skip back feature\n- Fix episodes without season numbers not showing in resume\n- Fix error for servers running on mono runtime\n- Filter duplicate entries in person credits\n- Improve search performance\n- Query fixes for extras belonging to multi-version movies\n- Fix cases of episode intro detection retrying failed files endlessly\n- Refresh metadata on playlists when removing items\n\r\n\r\n","upstream_url":"https://github.com/MediaBrowser/Emby.Releases/releases/tag/4.11.0.13"},"config":{"env":["PATH=/lsiopy/bin:/usr/local/sbin:/usr/local/bin:/usr/sbin:/usr/bin:/sbin:/bin","HOME=/root","LANGUAGE=en_US.UTF-8","LANG=en_US.UTF-8","TERM=xterm","S6_CMD_WAIT_FOR_SERVICES_MAXTIME=0","S6_VERBOSITY=1","S6_STAGE2_HOOK=/docker-mods","VIRTUAL_ENV=/lsiopy","LSIO_FIRST_PARTY=true","NVIDIA_DRIVER_CAPABILITIES=compute,video,utility","ATTACHED_DEVICES_PERMS=/dev/dri /dev/dvb /dev/vchiq /dev/video1? -type c"],"exposed_ports":["8096/tcp","8920/tcp"],"volumes":["/config"],"entrypoint":["/init"],"working_dir":"/"},"is_newest":false,"links":{"build":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/emby/builds/beta-4.11.0.13-ls4.json","diff":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/emby/builds/beta-4.11.0.13-ls4/diff.json","layers":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/emby/builds/beta-4.11.0.13-ls4/layers.amd64.json","arm64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/hub/api/v1/catalog/emby/builds/beta-4.11.0.13-ls4/layers.arm64.json"},"packages":{},"release":"https://github.com/linuxserver-playground/docker-emby/releases/tag/beta-4.11.0.13-ls4","pages":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-emby/builds/beta-4.11.0.13-ls4/","files":{"amd64":"https://linuxserver-playground.github.io/docker-emby/builds/beta-4.11.0.13-ls4/files.amd64.json.gz","arm64":"h